  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency support for the control of Foot and Mouth Disease (FMD) in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build capacity of DAHLD in control of TADs including the current outbreak of FMD
To build resilience to prevent future outbreaks built through enhanced surveillance, laboratory diagnosis and cross-border coordination.
To facilitate coordination of FMD control activities with neighboring countries, particularly with Mozambique and Zambia</narrative>
  </description>
